<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company is a limited liability company, with
SSLIP Alexandria LP and IREF Alexandria Investor holding ownership interests in the Company of 15% and 85%, respectively, for all periods
presented. The members are not personally liable for the debts, obligations, or liabilities of the Company solely by reason of being a
member, except as otherwise provided in the Company&rsquo;s operating agreement or applicable law. Contributions, distributions, profits,
and losses are allocated in accordance with the Company&rsquo;s operating agreement.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

